Day 63 - IAM Policies Investigation
Objective
Understand how IAM policies affect user permissions.

Investigation
Created IAM user
Attached AmazonS3ReadOnlyAccess
Tested access to S3 bucket
Findings
The user could view files but could not upload files.

Root Cause
The attached policy only allowed read operations.

Resolution
Replaced AmazonS3ReadOnlyAccess with AmazonS3FullAccess.

Key Takeaway
IAM policies determine what actions a user can perform on AWS resources.
